Fixed function-expression parenthesization in `packages/babel-generator/src/node/parentheses.ts`.

The postfix-context check now recognizes `UpdateExpression` parents. This lets the generator trace an IIFE through constructs such as `.map++` back to its expression statement and emit required parentheses:

```js
(function () {
  // ...
})().map++;
```

instead of invalid syntax:

```js
function () {
  // ...
}().map++;
```

